{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23978","headline":"夜宴惜别 · 白居易","name":"夜宴惜别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙歌旖旎曲终头，转作离声满坐愁。\n筝怨朱弦从此断，烛啼红泪爲谁流。\n夜长似岁欢宜尽，醉未如泥饮莫休。\n何况鸡鸣即须别，门前风雨冷修修。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}